   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dark light-play: median ~36 (the darkest street look), crushed blacks, warm shadows (27,20,18), clean highlights (222,215,203), the most saturated look (0.54) with red 39% plus magenta/purple accents. Best for: Reflections, coloured light, window and glass frames, night streets with pockets of light, abstract wedding-decor details. Dark and bold - hero frames only.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
